# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 9 as ruled (an event answer is the next tick's input, owed) and Type System ch. 2 ("Bundles": the bundle is answered part by part): each of the host's events reaches its own part of the child's place one tick after its click.
test two_event_parts_answered

tick 0
  added:
    0: Ui.Button(label="say")
    1: Ui.Button(label="drop")
    2/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="none, 0 lost")

